WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.334
The robot arm moves from the top center to the left, approaching the black bowl located between the plate and the ramekin. It lowers its gripper to grasp the bowl from above, lifts it, and moves it to the right to place it onto the plate.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Move arm towards the black bowl and lower gripper to grasp it

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Lift the black bowl and move it to the right

4
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Place the black bowl onto the plate and release
